---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'Define the question',
    body:
      'The registry owner defines the question, the service that may ask it, the purpose, and the possible response.',
    note: 'Question · service · purpose · response',
  },
  {
    title: 'Check the request',
    body:
      'Evidence Gateway authenticates the service and authorizes the complete predefined request before acquiring source credentials or reading data.',
    note: 'Requester · purpose · requirement',
  },
  {
    title: 'Read the current source record',
    body:
      'Evidence Gateway makes one fixed, bounded source request and validates the response. It does not browse candidates or copy the source record.',
    note: 'One source · bounded response',
  },
  {
    title: 'Derive, sign, audit, and release',
    body:
      'Evidence Gateway derives only the declared value, signs the assertion, records the disclosure, and then releases the response.',
    note: 'Minimum answer · signature · audit',
  },
];
---

<figure class="evidence-flow" aria-labelledby="evidence-flow-title">
  <div class="flow-intro">
    <p class="flow-kicker">How an evidence request is handled</p>
    <h3 id="evidence-flow-title">Evidence Gateway checks authority before reading the registry.</h3>
  </div>

  <ol class="flow-steps">
    {steps.map((step, index) => (
      <li>
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <div>
          <h4>{step.title}</h4>
          <p>{step.body}</p>
        </div>
        <span class="step-note">{step.note}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <div class="return-route" aria-label="Signed Evidence Gateway response">
    <div class="route-heading">
      <span>What the relying service receives</span>
      <p>One stateless signed assertion containing the approved answer.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="route-card route-service">
      <p class="route-label">Signed minimum-disclosure assertion</p>
      <h4>The service receives the answer, not the record</h4>
      <div class="answer-slip" aria-label="Example answer">
        <span>Business registration</span>
        <strong>Active</strong>
        <small>Source: business registry</small>
      </div>
      <p>The assertion carries its purpose, audience, validity, and an opaque subject binding. The relying service verifies it before use.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="audit-slip">
      <span class="audit-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <p>
        <strong>Two durable audit gates</strong>
        Authorized access is recorded before the source read. The released disclosure is recorded after signing and before the response leaves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    Evidence Gateway provides the approved registry fact. It does not decide eligibility, awards,
    enforcement, or case outcomes.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .evidence-flow {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: var(--registry-max);
  }

  .flow-intro {
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    max-width: 780px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .flow-intro h3 {
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 38px);
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }

  .flow-kicker,
  .route-label {
    color: var(--registry-blue);
    font-family: var(--registry-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .flow-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .flow-steps li {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--registry-rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 15px;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .flow-steps li:not(:last-child)::after {
    background: var(--registry-ink);
    content: '';
    height: 2px;
    position: absolute;
    right: -14px;
    top: 34px;
    width: 14px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .step-number {
    color: var(--registry-stamp);
    font-family: var(--registry-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .flow-steps h4 {
    color: var(--registry-ink);
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.22;
    margin: 0 0 9px;
  }

  .flow-steps p {
    color: var(--registry-body);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-note {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--registry-rule);
    color: var(--registry-muted);
    font-family: var(--registry-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .return-route {
    background: var(--registry-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--registry-rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);
    position: relative;
  }

  .return-route::before {
    background: var(--registry-ink);
    content: '';
    height: 18px;
    left: 50%;
    position: absolute;
    top: -19px;
    width: 2px;
  }

  .route-heading {
    align-items: baseline;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 20px;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .route-heading span {
    color: var(--registry-ink);
    font-family: var(--registry-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .route-heading p {
    color: var(--registry-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .route-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--registry-rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 13px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .route-card h4,
  .route-card > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .route-card h4 {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .route-card > p:last-child {
    color: var(--registry-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .answer-slip {
    border: 1px solid var(--registry-ink);
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 13px 15px;
  }

  .answer-slip {
    border-left: 5px solid var(--registry-blue);
  }

  .answer-slip span,
  .answer-slip small {
    color: var(--registry-muted);
    font-family: var(--registry-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }

  .answer-slip strong {
    color: var(--registry-ink);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .audit-slip {
    align-items: center;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--registry-rule);
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 13px 16px;
  }

  .audit-slip p {
    color: var(--registry-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .audit-slip strong {
    color: var(--registry-ink);
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .audit-mark {
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--registry-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    font-weight: 800;
    height: 30px;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 30px;
  }

  .evidence-flow figcaption {
    color: var(--registry-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 13px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .flow-steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .flow-steps li::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .flow-intro,
    .evidence-flow figcaption {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .flow-steps,
    .return-route {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .route-heading,
    .audit-slip {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .return-route::before {
      left: 30px;
    }

    .audit-slip {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
